This licence covers the source code, documentation and figures in this
repository only.

The SWAN-SF dataset is NOT covered by it. SWAN-SF v1.2 is distributed by its
authors through the Harvard Dataverse (DOI 10.7910/DVN/EBCFKM) under that
repository's own terms, and must be obtained from, and cited to, the original
authors:

  Angryk, R., Martens, P., Aydin, B., Kempton, D., Mahajan, S., Basodi, S.,
  Ahmadzadeh, A., Cai, X., Filali Boubrahimi, S., Hamdi, S. M., Schuh, M.,
  and Georgoulis, M. (2020). "Multivariate time series dataset for space
  weather data analytics." Scientific Data 7, 227.

Nothing in this repository redistributes the dataset. The trained model
artefacts in models/ are derived parameters, not dataset copies.
